{
  "_comment": "Copy this directory's contents into your repo's .claude/ (see TAILORING.md §Platform layer). Hooks load at SESSION START and hot-reload on config edits; agents/*.md do NOT hot-reload — restart the session after adding one. The SessionStart banner is the liveness proof: no banner, no hooks.",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume|clear|compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-session-start.sh\"",
            "timeout": 20,
            "statusMessage": "session brief"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-pretooluse-guard.sh\"",
            "timeout": 15,
            "statusMessage": "guard"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-pretooluse-secretread.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "secret-read guard"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-fast-gates.sh\"",
            "timeout": 30,
            "statusMessage": "fast gates"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-postbash-docgates.sh\"",
            "timeout": 30,
            "statusMessage": "doc gates (bash writes)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read|Bash|Agent|Task|Skill",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-read-budget.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "read budget"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-repeat-check.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "repeat check"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-precompact-log.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "compaction log"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-stop-statecheck.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "state check"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-stop-claimcheck.sh\"",
            "timeout": 20,
            "statusMessage": "claim check"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-stop-verifycheck.sh\"",
            "timeout": 20,
            "statusMessage": "verify check"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hook-repeat-check.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "repeat check"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "_comment_lsp": "Code intelligence (added 2026-09-29): enable your stack's official LSP plugin at PROJECT scope, e.g. `claude plugin install gopls-lsp@claude-plugins-official --scope project` (also rust-analyzer-lsp, typescript-lsp, pyright-lsp …). It writes an enabledPlugins entry here. The language-server binary must be on PATH (gopls, rust-analyzer, …). See TAILORING.md §Code intelligence.",
  "_comment_sandbox": "Unattended runs (headless, scheduled, cloud, or any session nobody is watching): turn on Claude Code's built-in Bash sandbox. It runs on macOS (Seatbelt, nothing to install), Linux and WSL2 (it relies on two system packages; /sandbox shows what is missing); native Windows is not supported. Add  \"sandbox\": {\"enabled\": true, \"failIfUnavailable\": true}  here, then narrow sandbox.network.allowedDomains and sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite to what the project needs. Leave sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed off unless you have read what it auto-approves. Interactive check: /sandbox. The guard still runs inside the sandbox: the sandbox limits WHERE a command can reach, the guard decides WHETHER an un-undoable one runs. See sops/security-baseline.md, Unattended runs."
}
